The existing `provider.tf` file was preserved.

## 2. Create variables.tf

The `variables.tf` file defines the required variable `KKE_user`, with the default value `iamuser_anita`.

### Configuration

```hcl
variable "KKE_user" {
  description = "IAM username to create"
  type        = string
  default     = "iamuser_anita"
}
```

### Command Used

```bash
cat > variables.tf <<'EOF'
variable "KKE_user" {
  description = "IAM username to create"
  type        = string
  default     = "iamuser_anita"
}
EOF
```

## 3. Create main.tf

The `main.tf` file declares the AWS IAM user resource and references the variable using `var.KKE_user`.

### Configuration

```hcl
resource "aws_iam_user" "KKE_user" {
  name = var.KKE_user
}
```

### Command Used

```bash
cat > main.tf <<'EOF'
resource "aws_iam_user" "KKE_user" {
  name = var.KKE_user
}
EOF
```

